{
  "title": "AxisAction",
  "description": "A named signed axis in -1..1, fed by a stick, by two opposing button groups, or by several such bindings at once. Alternative bindings are never summed. Each is evaluated on its own and the one with the largest absolute deflection wins; on an exact tie the binding listed first wins, so the outcome does not depend on device iteration order.",
